+
+## S01 explicit known-failure pin diagnostics (20261025)
+
+Idea sources: the user's S1 job and the supplied review
+`CR_PASS_sol_jobC_a0b6811f.txt`, item 7. Implementation is original test
+reporting code. Preserve prerequisite patch SHA256
+`4ac98f92d45f67fae8aaa8067fe28c0fca36662b3688013105f738245ee55805`.
+The follow-up prints the exact documented and observed move, score, depth
+and PV when a guarded known outcome drifts; it never relaxes the score pin
+or changes engine behavior. Re-recording is a separate reviewed action.
